; SquareWave_Spacing_Matrix_10Layers
; Bambu Lab P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG
; 60 mirrored pairs: original 40 uniform-scale tests, then 20 vertical-only tests
; Spacing convention: vertical-step spacing; requested sizes 0.1 through 1.0 mm
; Tests 01-40: uniform scaling, step 0.1-1.0 mm; tests 41-60: step 0.1-0.5 mm, bar widths fixed
; Six rows, 10 pairs per row; complete each pair before next, left to right then back
; Rows 1/2: uniform squareWave0.6mm; rows 3/4: uniform squareWave1mm
; Row 5: fixed 0.6 mm bars; row 6: fixed 1.0 mm bars; 4 mm clear gap between rows
; Line width 0.15 mm; layer height 0.06 mm; 10 layers, total height 0.60 mm per pair
; First layer 1 mm/s, PCF OFF. Layers 2-10 15 mm/s at selected 0% or 50% PCF
; Nozzle 245 C; bed 85 C; nozzle purge-line XY speed 20 mm/s
; Straight intro/outro remain 10 mm each regardless of geometry scaling
; 600 layer events. Startup/calibration retained except expanded bed-mesh region
; Matrix two-second fan settling and all other printing settings retained
; Static validation only; not physically printer-tested
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
